---
description: Go engineering standards for an enrolled repository
alwaysApply: true
---

Read .agents/skills/golaw/SKILL.md before Go work.
Run golaw context <area> before you explore an enrolled repository; create kinds with golaw new, fill their golaw:hole markers, and pass golaw gen --check before you finish.
Read a rule with golaw rules <id> and a checklist with golaw rules --checklist <name>.
This integration is a compatibility preview.
Write and Delete capture is not enforcement; post feedback is advisory.
Run golaw check once the change is written, it prints only the red gates, and golaw scan --staged before finishing staged work; local checks remain optional.
Use golaw doctor to distinguish installed, trusted and active hooks.
Ask before pushing or opening a pull request.
Never weaken golaw.yml to bypass a finding.
